@page "/"

<PageTitle>Day 6 Demonstration</PageTitle>

<h1>Day 6 Demonstration: Centralized State and the BYSResult Pattern</h1>

<p class="lead">
    This is the instructor demonstration project. It shows two things:
</p>

<div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Demo A: Dashboard Multi-Component Wiring</h5>
                <p class="card-text">
                    Three sibling components all subscribe to a single shared
                    <code>DashboardState</code> store slice. One action dispatch
                    updates all three at once.
                </p>
                <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-outline-primary mt-2 d-block">Go to Dashboard</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Demo B: Service Result&lt;T&gt; Refactor</h5>
                <p class="card-text">
                    The dashboard service returns <code>Result&lt;DashboardData&gt;</code>
                    and the effect checks <code>result.IsSuccess</code> instead of
                    wrapping the call in try/catch.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
